hadiths[82]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1671","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1672","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1673","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
"1674","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyub said"
"1675","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr from Jabir ibn Abdullah as-Salami that the Messenger of Allah"
"1676","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1677","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1678","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Bujayd (formerly al-Ansari) from his grandmother that the Messenger of Allah"
"1679","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj that Abu Hurayra said"
"1680","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1681","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Zayd ibn Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abi Bakras-Siddiq from Umm Salama"
"1682","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Habib"
"1683","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab and Ali ibn Abi Talib and Uthman ibn Affan drank while standing"
"1684","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that A'isha"
"1685","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu Jafar al-Qari said"
"1686","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az- Zubayr that his father used to drink while standing"
"1687","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1688","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1689","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say that Abu Talha had said to Umm Sulaym"
"1690","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1691","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1692","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from Abu Shurayh al-Kabi that the Messenger of Allah"
"1693","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"1694","Yahya related to me from Malik from Wahb ibn Kaysan that Jabir ibn Abdullah said"
"1695","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh from his grandmother that the Messenger of Allah"
"1696","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr said"
"1697","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Isa ibn Maryam used to say"
"1698","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1699","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab was eating bread with ghee. He summoned one of the desert people and he began to eat and follow the grease in the dish with a morsel of bread. Umar said"
"1700","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1701","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1702","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Halhala that Humayd ibn Malik ibn Khu'haym said"
"1703","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Nuaym that Wahb ibn Kaysan said"
"1704","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say that a man came to Abdullah ibn Abbas and said to him"
"1705","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father never brought food or drink"
"1706","Yahya said that Malik was asked"
"1707","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1708","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1709","Yahya related to me from Malik that Sadaqa ibn Yasar said"
"1710","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Abbad ibn Tamim that Abu Bashir al-Ansari told him that he was with the Messenger of Allah"
"1796","Malik related to me that he heard that when the Messenger of Allah"
"1797","Malik related to me from a reliable source of his from Yaqub ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj from Bushr ibn Said from Sad ibn Abi Waqqas from Khawla bint Hakim that the Messenger of Allah"
"1798","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1799","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala that Said ibn al-Musayyab heard the Messenger of Allah"
"1800","Malik related to me from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1801","Malik related to me from Abu Ubayd"
"1802","Malik related to me from Sumayy"
"1803","Malik related to me that he heard that Abu Hurayra said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1804","Malik related to me that he heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab went to the villages every Saturday. If he found a slave doing work which he was not capable of doing"
"1805","Malik related to me from his paternal uncle"
"1806","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1807","Malik related to me that he heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab saw a female slave belonging to Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab. She was dressed like free (non-slave) women. He went to his daughter Hafsa and said"
"1808","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1809","Malik related to me from Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir that Umayma bint Ruqayqa said"
"1810","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar wrote to Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan"
"1811","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1812","Malik related to me from Suhayl ibn Abu Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1813","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1814","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Isa ibn Maryam encountered a pig on the road. He said to it"
"1815","Malik related to me from Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqama from his father from Bilal ibn al-Harith al-Muzani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1816","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abu Salih as- Samman informed him that Abu Hurayra said"
"1817","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1818","Malik related to me that he heard that Isa ibn Maryam used to say"
"1819","Malik related to me that he heard that A'isha"
"1820","Malik related to me from al-Walid ibn Abdullah ibn Sayyad that al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Hantab al-Makhzumi informed him that a man asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1821","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1822","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab came upon Abu Bakr as-Siddiq pulling his tongue. Umar said to him"
"1823","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar saying"
"1824","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1825","Malik related to me from Safwan ibn Sulaym that a man asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1826","Malik related to me that he heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1827","Malik related to me that he heard that someone said to Luqman"
"1828","Malik related to me that he heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1829","Malik related to me that Safwan ibn Sulaym said"
"1830","Malik related to me from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1831","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1832","Malik related to me that he had heard that Umm Salama"
"1833","Malik related to me that Ismail ibn Abi Hakim heard Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz say"
"1834","Malik related to me from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1835","Malik said"
"1836","Malik related to me that Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr would stop speaking when he heard thunder and say"
"1837","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from A'isha"